<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gulf Island started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gulf Island started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said it started coverage of Gulf Island Fabrication Inc with a buy rating. </p>
<p>-- Analyst not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Earlier today, Gulf Island reported first quarter pro forma earnings per share rose to $0.57 from $0.12.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 2-1/8 to 20-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
